# Copy to .env. For a fully local Ollama run you need NOTHING in here — the
# scripts default OPENROUTER_API_KEY to the dummy value "ollama", which the
# Ollama server ignores.
#
# The pipeline's python scripts call load_dotenv(), so anything set here is
# picked up automatically.

# Only needed if you swap the judge back to a hosted model (see README
# "Swapping the judge"):
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
